        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 24th Hong Kong Film Awards\n- Films: 2046, Kung Fu Hustle\n- People: Wong Kar-wai, Stephen Chow, Raymond Wong\n- Roles: director, composer\n- Awards: Best Original Film Score\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Wong Kar-wai wrote and directed the Hong Kong romantic drama film 2046.\n- In 2004, Stephen Chow directed the martial arts film Kung Fu Hustle.\n- Raymond Wong composed the score for Kung Fu Hustle.\n- Raymond Wong's score for Kung Fu Hustle was nominated for the Best Original Film Score at the 24th Hong Kong Film Awards.\n- At the 24th Hong Kong Film Awards, twenty-nine winners in nineteen categories were unveiled.\n- At the 24th Hong Kong Film Awards, Kung Fu Hustle and 2046 were the year's biggest winners.",
